# [IDR](../wg/idr.html)

## Summary

The Inter-Domain Routing (IDR) Working Group met to discuss working group status, updates to core BGP specifications, BGP transport security, tunnel encapsulation, route reflector deployment best practices, next-hop and best-path selection criteria, SD-WAN discovery, and route leak prevention enhancements. 

Key milestones highlighted included ten drafts currently with the RFC Editor and two drafts at the IESG. The working group evaluated progress on `draft-ietf-idr-bgp4-rfc4271bis` (confirming consensus on an omnibus approach), updates to BGP over TLS, MASQUE tunnel signaling, route reflector deployment considerations, next-hop resolution enhancements, AD updates for SD-WAN discovery, and fast-tracking `draft-ietf-idr-otc-rs-verification` following active open-source implementation.

